; start_gcode = ; Ender-3 Pro Start G-code (Devil Design PLA)\nG28 ; Home all axes\nG92 E0 ; Reset extruder\nM140 S{first_layer_bed_temperature[0]} ; Start heating bed\nM104 S{first_layer_temperature[0]} ; Start heating nozzle\nM190 S{first_layer_bed_temperature[0]} ; Wait for bed temp\nM109 S{first_layer_temperature[0]} ; Wait for nozzle temp\nG1 Z5.0 F3000 ; Move Z up\nG1 X0.1 Y20 Z0.3 F5000.0 ; Move to start\nG1 X0.1 Y200.0 Z0.3 F1500.0 E15 ; Draw line 1\nG1 X0.4 Y200.0 Z0.3 F5000.0 ; Move\nG1 X0.4 Y20 Z0.3 F1500.0 E30 ; Draw line 2\nG92 E0 ; Reset extruder\nG1 E5 F300 ; Prime extruder (kompensacja retrakcji)\nG92 E0 ; Reset extruder\nG1 Z2.0 F3000 ; Lift Z\n; Start print
